    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yetro gabareasa Musa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 18:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abeeda Yetroheeda was Ashoohoocheanda ng'eanyiida Midiyani, was ghweanda gatmooda Musa, ea niyiiy ng'asheega sean sin ASEETA aba badayda Musa ea fugaaschi was Israeli, ea gidaruuteayda NG'UTAMIIDA fuga Israeli aba ng'eanyiida Misri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.18.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.18.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 18:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abeeda Yetroheeda was ghweanda gatmooda Musa, godedu Sipora was gatmooda Musa, ghayi abeeda niidealda gheanyaawa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.18.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.18.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 18:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "sea orjoagaaschi asiyeenya, aba jeedeaba suh akaleala geeguura gheawungaaschi Gershomu (aba gideaba gwayi, “Geawooschi rabascheanda aba ng'eanyiida rabasta”) ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.18.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.18.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 18:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak gheawungeaba niirja geeguura Elieseri (aba gideaba gwayi, “ASEETA bwaabwa ghaweadan, ak ghoaghuuhanaan ng'uta Farao”). ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.18.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.18.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 18:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghwaan Yetroheeda was ghweanda gatmooda Musa sea orjoagaaschi ea gatmoadaanyi ea ghwahita heeda Musa aba jeeda dareapcheeda, nea abeeda Musa ea niwus aba giijeeda ASEETA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.18.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.18.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 18:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwarukusa sih Musa gideaba “ghwaan ghweanda gatmoadaang'u was Yetro nea goodeana gatmoadaang'u aloojigaagu asiyeenya.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.18.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.18.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 18:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwarita Musa gawa ghwadeapta ghweanda gatmoadaanyi, nea gwatkuy aba madeadaanyi ak ghwasam gheata, hit giigeacheeda gaweay jeeda maheemajeanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.18.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.18.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 18:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwarukusa Musa ghweanda gatmoadaanyi ng'asheega sean sissa NG'UTAMIIDA Farao ea fuga Misri aba badayda fuga Israeli, ea ng'asheega hang'oonyi sean nyas aba naweeda, ea gidaweata NG'UTAMIIDA saawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.18.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.18.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 18:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gahoosan Yetro aba ng'asheega sean miyaasiin sissa NG'UTAMIIDA fuga Israeli ea gidaweata saawa aba geatinda fuga Misri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.18.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.18.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 18:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.18.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.18.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 18:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda Yetro ak gwayi, “Giigheambiita gaba NG'UTAMIIDA ghayi lealneegwa aba geatinda fuga Misri, ea geatinda Farao. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.18.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.18.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 18:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi ghamneawa ghaanali gideaba NG'UTAMIIDA eahaweewa aseecheeka sean, aba gideaba gwalealu buuneeda aba geatinda fuga Misri, ea aba sawanadeeda ghayi nyas saawa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.18.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.18.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 18:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gageanu Yetroheeda was ghweanda gatmooda Musa ak ghoadaw ASEETA haleanjeeda sisaba geadi bea ghadooweeda sighwarda ea lukghumeeda, iidu ghwahidu Haruni nea goodeana gweargwa sean bea Israeli, ghapka ghwaak mukaate sea ghweanda gatmooda Musa aba madeeda ASEETA.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.18.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.18.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Loota fuga laja girgweaguutka",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 18:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.18.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.18.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 18:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iimuchu sakteayda goopteada Musa ghwalach girgweaguutka buuneeda, ak ghamiinaada buuneeda nea gwaneaweesa Musa ghang'eada sakteayda ea ghoah shing'ada. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.18.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.18.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 18:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean nea ghwadaah ghweanda gatmooda Musa ng'asheega sean sin Musa aba badayda buuneeda ghwalamda ak gwayeesha, “Nih naaha gil iisini aba badahuuka buuneedean? Ghwasaan anda giipteadi nea gibwaageaw, nea ghamiinaada buuneeda nea gwaneaweeseey ghang'eada sakteayda ea ghoah shing'ada?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.18.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.18.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 18:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda Musa ak gwayeesha ghweanda gatmoadaanyi, “Ghapka heedeanyu aba gideaba gagasa ghoanyaash ASEETA gidagasa gwasissa saawa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.18.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.18.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 18:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "inyeesa iimideawa ng'asheanda ghapka heedeanyu, inyeesa geaheeli siida ea giischeewoocheandaanyi, ak ghaanung' ghwanal digheanyeeka ASEETA ea deaweedajeagaaschi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.18.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.18.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 18:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda ghweanda gatmooda Musa ak gwayeesha, “Gadiyeeni isiniin miimiy. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.18.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.18.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 18:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba sareani gayriba ang'iing'i ea fiisu indeawiini aba gideaba gadiyeeni ea durumwana muuchi aba headaang'u, miimuusi sina nea gibwaageaw. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.18.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.18.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 18:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi aleeysean iit deabaloolnyi, ak gagasa gwanda headaang'u ASEETA! Ak gajuna madeeda ASEETA aba badahuuka buuneeda, nea giyeasi ASEETA ng'asheega nyaawa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.18.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.18.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 18:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak gajanaala saawa ghwanal digheanyeeka ea deaweedajeega, ak gayweada saawa ghwanal naweeda ea gichea gwasin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.18.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.18.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 18:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ea meakghusa nih, aba jeedeaba fiisu seaniin gassa fuga awali gheang'da ASEETA, fuga doobiiweadi, was fuga magasa seawshooda, ak ginung' goombal fiisu, buuneeda ambal sagalamnyoojiga ea fuga was bughalajeega ea fuga was haradam ea damanamughuushcheeka, ea gea ambal damanamughuushcheeka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.18.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.18.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 18:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gaygoorgweakiisa buuneeda galeagasean, ak ng'asheega hees durumani gajeeyeaneey, sighus ng'asheega manang'i sean gaygwasin saawa, nea gabwa geat, ak aba headaang'u gayghawususiit, ak gayghwasar sareani sea ang'iing'i. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.18.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.18.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 18:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inyas gisini ng'asheanji, ak ghamwas ASEETA gajandeayeena sea fiisu, ak fiisu gaygaweay gealga nyaawa nea gaba hoyyoo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.18.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.18.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 18:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.18.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.18.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 18:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gooleeysiit Musa ng'asheega ghweanda gatmoadaanyi, ak gwasinda ng'asheega sean gisirukusiinda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.18.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.18.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 18:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghwaloat Musa fuga ammu gadiyeeda aba jeeda fuga sean bea Israeli, ak ghwanung' gaweay saawa madeeda buuneeda, ak goombal sagalamnyoojiga, ea bughalajeega, ea haradam ea damanamughuushcheeka, ea damanamughuushcheeka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.18.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.18.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 18:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak geergweakiisa buuneeda galeagasean, nea ng'asheega hang'oonyi inyeesa geeyeassa Musa, sighus gea manang'i gwasin saawa nea gabwageat. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.18.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.18.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 18:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwasiksa Musa ghweanda gatmoadaanyi hean ghang'eat gawa ng'eanyiida nyaawa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.18.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.18.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
